@page
@model CoreValuesModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The Khurshid Institute - Our Core Values";
}

<div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
    <h1>Our Core Values</h1>
</div>

<div>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Public Interest First</p>
            <p>We design and deliver solutions that prioritize the public good, community impact, and long-term institutional benefit over short-term gains.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to evaluate every project decision based on its impact on residents, communities, and public trust—not just operational efficiency.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Integrity and Accountability</p>
            <p>We operate with honesty, transparency, and ethical responsibility in all engagements, ensuring trust with public institutions and the communities they serve.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to communicate honestly, document decisions clearly, and accept responsibility for outcomes. We do not oversell, overpromise, or obscure limitations.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Practical Innovation</p>
            <p>We believe innovation should be useful, measurable, and implementable. Technology must solve real problems, not create new ones.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to implement solutions that are realistic, scalable, and maintainable within existing public-sector capacity and budgets.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Data-Informed Decision-Making</p>
            <p>We champion evidence-based governance by turning data into clear insights that support responsible policy, planning, and operations.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to evaluate every project decision based on its impact on residents, communities, and public trust—not just operational efficiency.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Accessibility and Inclusion</p>
            <p>We build solutions that are intuitive, inclusive, and accessible to diverse users, ensuring equitable participation across departments and communities.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to design systems that are usable by staff with varying technical skills and accessible to diverse communities, including multilingual and equity-seeking groups.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Partnership over Procurement</p>
            <p>We work as long-term partners to public organizations, collaborating closely to understand context, constraints, and objectives.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to engage as long-term collaborators, investing time to understand organizational culture, legislative frameworks, and operational constraints.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Stewardship of Public Resources</p>
            <p>We respect the responsibility that comes with public funding by delivering cost-effective solutions that maximize value and sustainability.</p>
            <p class="bullet-content">Our behavioural commitment is to manage time, budgets, and technology choices carefully, recognizing our responsibility to taxpayers, funders, and stakeholders.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>